# Local install artifacts from `npx skills add` / `npx clawhub` run in this repo —
# NEVER run those installers from inside this source repo (they symlink skills/<name>
# into these paths, which git sees as deleting the real tracked files). Run them from
# a scratch directory pointed at the GitHub URL instead.
.agents/*
!.agents/plugins/
.agents/plugins/*
!.agents/plugins/marketplace.json
.claude/
agent/
skills-lock.json
.clawhub/
